[~accountid:604aad643ab18c0068ef0136] Delayed captures was never supposed to support 0 pre-auth amount. The whole logic was added to delay captures for already authorised payments because refunds are slow in Azerbaijan.

Auto-retries in {{legacy}} implemented as a single payment with multiple capture payment_row records. And {{prepare.amount = 0}} is used in capture processing logic to distinguish pre-authorised and post-order payments

For post-order payments we don’t need to delay {{authorise}} request, but we need to delay {{capture}} request . Seems like we don’t have a good solution to postpone {{captures}} for {{auto-retries}}

