outcome of the research: the main part that fraud service is missing is decisions to skip pre-auth:
in payments it solves one function:


{noformat}private shouldSkipPreAuth(ctx: Context, input: BookingAmountRequest): boolean {
        const dynamicConfig = this.dynamicConfigStore.get().pre_auth.skip_conditions;
        if (input.pre_auth_amount.prepare_type !== InappOrderPaymentPrepareType.ADJUST_AUTH) {
            if (input.successful_auth_exists) {
                logger.info(ctx, "shouldSkipPreAuth: successful pre-auth exists", input);
                return true;
            }
            if (
                input.seconds_from_created &&
                input.seconds_from_created < dynamicConfig.skip_if_card_added_less_than_sec &&
                dynamicConfig.disable_skip_for_providers[input.payment_method_type] !== true &&
                dynamicConfig.disable_skip_in_countries[input.country] !== true
            ) {
                logger.info(ctx, "shouldSkipPreAuth: pre-auth skipped", input);
                return true;
            }
        }
        return false;
    }{noformat}

configuration for which can be found at [https://admin.bolt.eu/payment/DynamicConfigPaymentOrder/|https://admin.bolt.eu/payment/DynamicConfigPaymentOrder/] → choose {{pre_auth.skip_conditions}}

